cue0140051
00:56:20.328 --> 00:56:28.848
But it is an exception, Isha Yorev Aracha Leibov. If a man up not his heart, he shall not go to the army, he shall be relieved.

cue0140052
00:56:28.848 --> 00:56:32.568
Why I should not be relieved from this killing, this gilul?

cue0140053
00:56:32.568 --> 00:56:37.728
Alright, I'm just saying, Joseph Qaro has none of the laws applying to army,

cue0140054
00:56:37.728 --> 00:56:46.928
Anything to do with the shedding of blood, in any way, they are eliminated by the Shukran Aruch.

cue0140055
00:56:46.928 --> 00:56:52.928
It does not try them, you know. And that in a sense, Jewish law becomes much stronger because of this.

cue0140056
00:56:52.928 --> 00:56:53.928
Yes ma'am.

cue0140057
